                answer="&lt;p&gt;When booking online one infant can be booked per adult.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If more than one infant is travelling with the same adult, each additional infant must occupy a seat and be restrained in an approved &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.qantas.com/en-au/travel-information/flying-infants-children#bassinets-car-seats&quot;&gt;child car seat or restraint&lt;/a&gt;. If this applies to you, please contact us to arrange your booking.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.qantas.com/en-au/help/contact-us&quot;&gt;Contact us to make a booking&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
                answer_x0040_ContentType="text/html"
                cq:tags="[airline:travel/infants,airline:market/au,airline:market/nz]"
                question="Travelling with more than one infant per adult"
                sortOrder="{Long}40"
                tags="[airline:travel/infants,airline:market/au,airline:market/nz]"/>
